  "_about": "Realism scorecard v2 (realism plan, Phase 0). Each metric scores 10 inside its band [lo, hi] and falls linearly to 0 at fail_lo / fail_hi. A category is the weighted mean of its measured metrics, capped by open visual checks (any open high = 8.0, any open medium = 9.0; visual-only categories score 10 - 2 per high - 1 per medium - 0.5 per low). src: 'sim:<key>' = SimCalibrate --json (200 headless games), 'game:<dotted.path>' = analyze.py R dict of a filmed game, 'box:<key>' = gamestats.py of a filmed game. ref: where the band comes from; 'approx' = not yet sourced.",
